# Continuous autopilot + Auto models

Full text: [docs/governance/continuous-autopilot.md](docs/governance/continuous-autopilot.md). Handoff: [docs/governance/HANDOFF.md](docs/governance/HANDOFF.md).

## Models

Always use **Auto** (Cursor Auto / `inherit`) for this agent and every subagent/Task. Do **not** select named models (Opus, Sonnet, GPT, Grok, etc.) unless the human explicitly requests a model for that turn.

## Continuous drill

Non-colliding milestones may proceed in parallel, each on its own branch and pull request. When a milestone merges to `main`, continue remaining milestones whose dependencies are on `main`, including ones already in progress on their own branches. Loop: exhaust parity → 100% coverage → docs write/rewrite → commit → PR → automerge through **M13** (full Almasix ledger in `MILESTONES.md`). Do not pause for permission. Do not implement two milestones on one branch. Do not expand a milestone into a later milestone’s checklist. After one merges, rebase any parallel branch that needs those changes before merging it.

Stop only for ruleset blocks (Law 9), security/destructive approvals, or unrecoverable environment failure.
